# Torvus Bog 0g_swamp_hall layer 3: CPlantScarabSwarm e0c1e00b6 (the uid in `obj` varies per boot).
# psc4: god-mode player stands beside the swarm so real boids take attack slots (the fixture needs a
# real slot-0 owner), shifts position once, and reports.  1200 frames, fast.
@f220 layer 3
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give missile 250; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; fastmorph 1
@f380 send e001e00b6 Activate
@f420 tp -153.0 -66.0 37.0
@f600 obj e001e00b6
@f800 tp -150.5 -67.5 36.0
@f1000 obj e001e00b6
@f1190 obj e001e00b6
